# Prebuilt llama.cpp xcframework (built by Scripts/build-llama-xcframework.sh;
# adopters get the checksummed release asset — never committed).
Vendor/llama/
# Prebuilt llama.cpp Linux static lib (built by Scripts/build-llama-linux.sh;
# adopters get the checksummed release asset). Headers under Vendor/llama-headers/
# ARE committed (the systemLibrary modulemap) — only the built lib is ignored.
Vendor/llama-linux/
# Prebuilt llama.cpp Windows static lib (built by Scripts/build-llama-windows.ps1;
# adopters get the checksummed release asset). Shares Vendor/llama-headers/.
Vendor/llama-windows/
# Repackaged ONNX Runtime Apple xcframework (built by
# Scripts/vendor-onnxruntime-apple.sh; adopters get the checksummed release
# asset — never committed).
Vendor/onnxruntime/
# Vendored ONNX Runtime Android .so per ABI (built by
# Scripts/vendor-onnxruntime-android.sh; adopters get the checksummed
# release asset). Headers under Vendor/onnxruntime-android-headers/ ARE
# committed (the systemLibrary modulemap) — only the .so is ignored.
Vendor/onnxruntime-android/
# Vendored ONNX Runtime desktop libs (Linux .so / Windows .dll+.lib, built by
# Scripts/vendor-onnxruntime-{linux,windows}.sh; adopters get the checksummed
# release asset). Headers under Vendor/onnxruntime-desktop-headers/ ARE
# committed (the shared systemLibrary modulemap) — only the libs are ignored.
Vendor/onnxruntime-desktop/
# Vendored ONNX Runtime desktop GPU libs (Linux CUDA .so's / Windows DirectML
# .dll+.lib, built by Scripts/vendor-onnxruntime-{linux-gpu,windows-directml}.sh;
# adopters get the checksummed release asset). The DirectML headers under
# Vendor/onnxruntime-directml-headers/ ARE committed (module ONNXRuntimeDirectML,
# ORT 1.24.4 — a separate API version from the 1.27 desktop set); only the libs
# are ignored. (Linux GPU reuses the committed 1.27 onnxruntime-desktop-headers.)
Vendor/onnxruntime-desktop-gpu/
